@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam ArrowColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #111111
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #111111
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white

actor "用户" as User
participant "搜索页" as Page
participant "GetUserQuestionSearchController" as Controller
participant "QuestionVectorService" as SearchService
participant "ServiceAiFeign" as Feign
participant "UserSearchEmbeddingController" as EmbedService
database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
participant "IdConversionService" as IdService

User -> Page: 输入查询文本
Page -> Controller: POST /user/search/similarity-search
Controller -> SearchService: searchSimilarQuestions(queryText)
SearchService -> Feign: 请求文本向量化
Feign -> EmbedService: 生成查询向量
EmbedService --> Feign: 返回 embedding
Feign --> SearchService: 返回 embedding
SearchService -> Qdrant: 相似度检索
Qdrant --> SearchService: 返回候选题目
SearchService -> IdService: 转换真实ID为虚拟ID
IdService --> SearchService: 返回虚拟ID
SearchService --> Controller: 返回结果集合
Controller --> Page: 展示相似题目列表
@enduml
